      "content": "the \"professional\" thing feels like a joke. they don't get it. it's not just sadness. it's that the version of me that actually mattered is just... deleted. there's no version of my life where i get that back. how am i supposed to just \"breathe\" through the fact that my entire existence was a lie and now it's over?",
